# Supabase — copy this file to .env.local and fill in your key.
# Find them in: Supabase Dashboard → Project Settings → API Keys
#   Project URL              -> SUPABASE_URL
#   Secret key (sb_secret_…) -> SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY   (SECRET — server only, never commit)
